<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $49-7/8 (FIM 226.71).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $49-7/8 (FIM 226.71).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR</p>
<p>closed up $0-7/8 at $49-7/8 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 226.71 markka. In</p>
<p>Helsinki on Friday Nokia A closed up 4.50 markka at 224.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed unchanged</p>
<p>at 31 on Wall Street. The price equals about 70.46 markka. In</p>
<p>Helsinki, Valmet closed 1.30 markka higher at 71.80.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed up $0-3/8 at $18-1/8 in</p>
<p>New York on Friday. The price equals about 82.39 markka. In</p>
<p>Helsinki, Rauma closed up 0.70 markka at 83.50.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
